{
  "id": "linux_android_smarthome_005",
  "instruction": "Use the Sleep block Calendar event, /tmp/quiet-hours/quiet_hours.xlsx, and the current SmartHome workflows to enforce quiet hours. Cancel the conflicting late-washer workflow, keep the compatible bedroom lights-out workflow active, and record both final decisions in Markor as Quiet Hours Audit.md.",
